## 1. Verified KPI Targets

Goal: Reduce waiting times for credential requests before notifying students of cancellations, ensuring that requests do not sit idle during processing.

  1. Average Waiting Time Before Cancellation Notification [time] — minimize (scope: end_to_end)

Reasoning: This KPI set aligns with the simulation goal by focusing on reducing waiting times and ensuring timely notifications for cancelled requests. Each KPI is measurable based on the event log evidence, with clear definitions and formulas grounded in the process description. The set includes a direct measure of waiting time, a quality metric for notification efficiency, and a duration KPI for the validation process, all of which are essential for improving the overall efficiency of the credential requests process.

These KPIs have been human-verified. Minimize/maximize KPIs are your optimisation targets. Maintain KPIs are constraints — your scenario must not degrade them.

